# Testing and logging rules

- Add unit tests for authorization boundaries.
- Add integration tests for discovery expiry, wrong tokens, and generic errors.
- Add tests that server message schemas do not include plaintext fields.
- Add tests for delete-on-disconnect and purge receipts.
- Add tests for screenshot/screen-recording control events.
- Logs must use structured metadata only. Never log message content, keys, tokens, or phone numbers unless explicitly redacted.
- Crash/analytics SDKs must be configured to block message content and private metadata before beta.
